# MQTT and Home Assistant Integration

## MQTT Client
The MQTT implementation in [src/mqtt.rs](mdc:src/mqtt.rs) handles:
- Connection management to MQTT brokers
- Message publishing and subscription
- Topic routing and message handling
- Connection health monitoring

## Home Assistant Integration
The Home Assistant module in [src/home_assistant.rs](mdc:src/home_assistant.rs) provides:
- Automatic device discovery
- Entity state management
- Configuration validation
- Integration with HA add-on system

## Message Patterns
- Use typed message structures for MQTT communication
- Implement proper topic hierarchies for organization
- Support message retention where appropriate
- Handle QoS levels appropriately

## Discovery and Configuration
- Implement Home Assistant MQTT discovery protocol
- Provide device and entity metadata
- Support configuration updates
- Handle entity state changes

## Error Handling
- Implement connection retry logic
- Handle MQTT broker failures gracefully
- Log connection issues appropriately
- Provide fallback behavior when possible
